                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Simple game where the only two things you need to do are: Walk and move your camera.\n\nYou can easly complete it in 10 minutes, you might die a couple of times at the last level, but it's still fun.\n\nI assume it's just a prologue to a \"full version\" that will be released someday.\n\nThe only things that i hope will be in the full game are:\n1. Options menu before you actually enter the game\n2. Colors matching the character (I noticed that after you finish the game arms/legs and prob something else have different colors on the ending art in-game! You wont get away with that dev, lmao)\n\nTL;DR it's a really short (but fun tbh) game that you can complete once in 10 minutes (Unless you want to speedrun it) and if you'll like it just wait for the full release.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1514483791,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1528490911,
